      { title: "IPS — Intrusion Prevention", color: C.green, items: ["Monitors AND blocks", "Inline — traffic passes through it", "Active packet drop capability", "Blocks: exploits, C2 traffic", "Tools: Suricata, Snort (IPS mode)", "Best for: active defense"] },
